	(text "VBAT sense divider: R803 100k / R804 15k  ->  ratio 15/115 = 0.1304.\n  4S full (16.8 V) -> 2.19 V at ADC (PC1).  ADC clips (3.3 V) at ~25.3 V in.\n  Quiescent load on VBAT: 16.8 V / 115 k = 146 uA (~2.5 mW). Negligible.\n  Source impedance 100k||15k = 13.0 k; C801 100nF -> ~1.3 ms RC, ~120 Hz.\n  Use a long ADC sample time (>= 84 cyc) for this impedance."
		(at 30 128 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8dd96e9c-e299-4e88-8b56-162ea72b6c58")
	)
	(text "USB 2.0 data: D+/D- through U801 USBLC6-2SC6 ESD array (also clamps VBUS).\nCON side -> USB_D*_CON, MCU side -> USB_DP (PA12) / USB_DM (PA11) globals.\nCC1/CC2 -> 5.1k to GND (R801/R802): UFP, advertises default USB (no PD).\nSBU1/SBU2 unused (no-connect). SHIELD tied to GND.\nC802 1uF: VBUS local decoupling."
		(at 30 40 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "82898cad-c423-4590-acd7-bf536a684dc0")
	)
